      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Grek grc">
               <pb n="convex" /><lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" /><expan><abbr>διέγρ̣α̣ψ</abbr><ex>εν</ex></expan>
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#26590"><expan><abbr>Πατσεῖβ</abbr><ex>τις</ex></expan>
                  <surname><expan><abbr>Π̣<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ετορ</supplied></abbr><supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost"><ex>ζμήθιος</ex></supplied></expan></surname></persName>
               <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" /><rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id350" type="title"><expan><abbr>παστοφ</abbr><ex>όρος</ex></expan></rs>
               <expan><abbr>ὑπ</abbr><ex>ὲρ</ex></expan>
               <expan><abbr>λαο<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">γ</supplied>ρ̣αφ</abbr><ex>ίας</ex></expan>
               <date notAfter="+91" notBefore="+90" when-custom="Domitian:10">δεκ̣άτ̣ου (ἔτους) <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" />Δομιτιανοῦ τοῦ κυρίο̣υ̣</date> ἐ̣π̣ὶ <expan><abbr>λ</abbr><ex>όγου</ex></expan>
               <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right" />(δραχμὰς) τέσσαρα̣ς̣ (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) δ. ὁμο<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ίως (δραχμὰς) δ (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) η. </supplied><expan><abbr><supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ὁ</supplied>μ̣</abbr><ex>οίως</ex></expan> (δραχμὰς) δ <lb n="5" rend="left-to-right" />(γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ιβ. ὁμοίως (δραχμὰς) γ <supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">(γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ιε. ὁμ(οίως) (δραχμὴν) α (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ιϛ.</supplied>
               <lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#4077"><expan><abbr><supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">Σωκ</supplied>ράτη</abbr><ex>ς</ex></expan></persName>
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id122" type="title"><expan><abbr>πράκ</abbr><ex>τωρ</ex></expan></rs>
               <expan><abbr>ἔ̣<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">γρ</supplied></abbr><supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost"><ex>αψα</ex></supplied></expan>. <lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" />ὁ̣ α̣ὐ̣τ̣ὸ̣ς̣ <expan><abbr>ὁ̣μ</abbr><ex>οίως</ex></expan>
               <supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ὑπ(ὲρ) χει(ρωναξίου) ι (ἔτους)</supplied> ἐ̣π̣ὶ̣ <expan><abbr>λ</abbr><ex>όγου</ex></expan> (δραχμὰς) γ. ὁμοίως <lb n="8" rend="left-to-right" /><supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ἄλλας (δραχμὰς) δ</supplied> (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ζ̣. ὁ̣<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">μοίως</supplied> (δραχμὰς) δ (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ια. <lb n="9" rend="left-to-right" />ὁμοίως (δραχμὴν) α (γίνονται) (δραχμαὶ) ι<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">β</supplied>. <lb n="10" rend="left-to-right" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#4077">Σωκράτης</persName>
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id122" type="title"><expan><abbr>πράκ</abbr><ex>τωρ</ex></expan></rs>
               <expan><abbr>ἔγρα</abbr><ex>ψα</ex></expan>.  </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="convex" /><lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" />Thus has paid Patsibtis, son of Petorzmethis, <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" />shrine-bearer, for poll tax of the tenth year <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" />Domitian the lord, on account, <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right" />four dr., = 4 dr. Ditto, 4 dr., = 8 dr. Ditto, 4 dr., <lb n="5" />= 12 dr. Ditto, 3 dr., = 15 dr. Ditto, 1 dr., = 16 dr.<lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" />Sokrates, collector, I have written.<lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" />The same, ditto, for trade tax of year 10, on account, 3 dr. Ditto,<lb n="8" rend="left-to-right" />further 4 dr., = 7 dr. Ditto, 4 dr, = 11 dr. <lb n="9" rend="left-to-right" />Ditto, 1 dr., = 12 dr. <lb n="10" rend="left-to-right" />Sokrates, collector, I have written. </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text></TEI>